{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19258","headline":"送工部张侍郎入蕃吊祭 · 刘禹锡","name":"送工部张侍郎入蕃吊祭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月窟宾诸夏，云官降九天。\n饰终邻好重，锡命礼容全。\n水咽犹登陇，沙鸣稍极边。\n路因乘驿近，志爲饮冰坚。\n毳帐差池见，乌旗摇曳前。\n归来赐金石，荣耀自编年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}